---
title: MP3 upload and result sequence
query: >-
  Show the implemented Analyze MP3 request and response sequence through the browser, NGINX, Fastify API on Node and
  pure parser. Separate page components, the upload-state hook and raw request/response service inside the browser.
  Include local file validation, pending controls, the actual-byte 20 MiB bound, typed parser failures,
  proxy failures, JSON validation and restored controls after every outcome. Count complete physical MPEG-1 Layer III
  frames including metadata-bearing frames. Keep errors readable and show that aborted uploads cannot succeed.
  Use only behavior supported by the referenced files; this is not a cloud deployment diagram.
  Group NGINX inside the frontend Docker container and API plus parser inside the API Docker container. The API and
  parser share one Node process; browser JavaScript runs outside Docker. Never draw the parser as a third container.
references:
  - "File: /frontend/src/App.tsx"
  - "File: /frontend/src/response.ts"
  - "File: /frontend/src/hooks/useMp3Analysis.ts"
  - "File: /frontend/src/services/mp3Analysis.ts"
  - "File: /frontend/src/services/response.ts"
  - "File: /frontend/src/types/analysis.ts"
  - "File: /frontend/src/components/UploadForm.tsx"
  - "File: /frontend/src/components/AnalysisResult.tsx"
  - "File: /frontend/nginx.conf.template"
  - "File: /server/src/http.ts"
  - "File: /server/src/mp3.ts"
  - "File: /frontend/Dockerfile"
  - "File: /server/Dockerfile"
  - "File: /compose.yaml"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser as Browser page components
    participant Hook as Browser upload hook
    participant Service as Browser API service
    box rgb(224,242,254) Frontend Docker container
        participant Frontend as NGINX :8080
    end
    box rgb(220,252,231) API Docker container - one Node process
        participant API as Fastify on Node :3000
        participant Parser as In-process parser
    end
    User->>Browser: Select file
    Browser->>Hook: selectFile resets prior result
    User->>Browser: Analyze MP3
    Browser->>Hook: analyze on form submit
    alt Missing file or file exceeds 20 MiB
        Hook-->>Browser: Readable local error
        Browser-->>User: Display error
    else File passes local validation
        Hook->>Hook: Admit one request, set pending and start deadline
        Hook-->>Browser: Disable pending controls
        Hook->>Service: Await analysis of selected File with abort signal
        Service->>Frontend: Await raw POST /file-upload via published loopback port
        alt Ingress rejection or unavailable/timed-out upstream
            Frontend-->>Service: Error status and JSON
        else Request forwarded over HTTP/1.1 without buffering or retry
            Frontend->>API: Forward raw bytes to api:3000 on Compose network
            API->>API: Raw path/method bridge, then ordered Fastify admission
            API->>API: Custom stream parser bounds actual bytes and deadlines
            alt Invalid request, over limit, busy or timed out
                API-->>Frontend: Contracted error status and JSON
            else Complete nonempty body within 20 MiB
                API->>Parser: POST route counts complete physical MPEG-1 Layer III frames
                alt Valid supported file
                    Parser-->>API: Positive count including metadata-bearing frames
                    API-->>Frontend: 200 JSON with frameCount
                else Invalid or unsupported structure
                    Parser-->>API: Typed failure
                    API-->>Frontend: 400 or 415 JSON
                end
            end
            Frontend-->>Service: Preserve API status and JSON
        end
        Service->>Service: Await JSON and validate exact success shape
        Service-->>Hook: Typed count or readable error
        Hook->>Hook: Apply only the current request generation
        Hook-->>Browser: Render result and restore controls
        Browser-->>User: Count or readable error#59; allow retry
        Hook->>Hook: Always clear this request's deadline
    end
    Note over Hook,Service: Selection and unmount abort requests#59; stale outcomes never update the page
    Note over Hook,API: Abort or network failure is not partial success
    Note over API,Parser: Release bounded upload memory#59; no MediaInfo, retained upload or background job
